                <mxCell id="6xj1JYLc1hOEaHPAmoyw-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=17;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;- &lt;b&gt;before_agent&lt;/b&gt;: Runs once when the agent starts, before anything else happens.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;- &lt;b&gt;before_model&lt;/b&gt;: Runs before every LLM call and can change the messages going to the LLM.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;- &lt;b&gt;wrap_model_call&lt;/b&gt;: Holds every LLM call. Our code runs first, then makes the call, then sees the reply.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;- &lt;b&gt;after_model&lt;/b&gt;: Runs after every LLM call and can check or change the LLM&#39;s reply.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;- &lt;b&gt;wrap_tool_call&lt;/b&gt;: Holds every tool call. Our code runs first, then runs the tool, then sees the result&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;- &lt;b&gt;after_agent&lt;/b&gt;: Runs once when the agent is done, after the final answer.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
